Message-ID: <00e201c448b2$e525e120$83d1aa87@zhaopc>

Mike,

 

Here is one way to solve your question using the 
Splus dimnames to do the mapping.

 

Let data1 be your target data, and data 2 be 
the data frame where it's Id-to-Name mapping is stored in the first 2 columns. 
The following code should solve your problem.

--------------------------------------------------

Id2NameMap_unique(data2[,1:2])

dimnames(Id2NameMap)[[1]]_as.character(Id2NameMap[,1]) 

data1[,2]_Id2NameMap[as.character(data1[,2]),2]

--------------------------------------------------

 

Hope this help.

Max Zhao

 

 

