I think this is what you are asking for.

y1 <- rnorm(20)
y2 <- 3 + rnorm(20)

plot(x=c(1,20), y=range(y1,y2), type="n")
lines(x=1:20, y=y1)
lines(x=1:20, y=y2)

Rich

