From maustin at amgen.com  Mon Oct  4 16:40:31 2004
From: maustin at amgen.com (Austin, Matt)
Date: Mon, 04 Oct 2004 09:40:31 -0700
Subject: Re: Shading sections of a graph
In-Reply-To: <OFE2B51AD0.AA5C5628-ON85256F23.00582A24-85256F23.00587BF1@EU.novartis.net>
Message-ID: <E7D5AB4811D20B489622AABA9C53859101F11395@teal-exch.amgen.com>

?polygon

 

Example

plot(1:100, ylim=c(0,5), type="n") 

lower <- runif(100, 0, 1)

upper <- runif(100, 2, 3)

polygon( c(1:100, 100:1), c(lower, upper), col=2) 

--Matt

