when the # of parameters exceed the # of samples/subject (sparse data 
situation). While other software like NONMEM gave estimates that made sense to 
us. If you think syntax is appropriate, I would recommend simulating a rich 
dataset using the model under evaluation to eliminate this 
possibility.

 

Hope it is helpful

 

