I want to thank the helpful suggestions from Max Zhao, Bill Dunlap, 
Dimitris Rizopoulos and Shawn Boles. Max suggested to use option 
"singular.ok=T" to deal with collinearity. Bill suggested to use

x<- try(lm(...))

result[i]<- if (inherits(x, "Error")) NA else summary(x)$coefficients[2,4]

Both Dimitris and Shawn suggested to use try(expr). Thanks to all of you!

