Hi Laura,

you could use:

mat <- matrix(NA, 10, 10)

mat[col(mat)>row(mat)] <- 1:15

####

mat[col(mat)<row(mat)] <- 0 # optional: use it if the lower part is 
not zero

mat

mat+t(mat)

I hope it helps.

Best,
Dimitris

