You may need to supply a little more detail on your process to get a better
answer.  If you are initializing S-Plus in batch mode you can specify what
working directory you want to use in your process (look at the help pages
for the arguments to BATCH).  If you don't specify an explicit path for your
figure, the figure will be placed in the working directory you specified.
If you haven't specified a working directory it will revert to the default
working directory for your setup, which if you haven't changed from your
original installation will probably be in the main S-Plus installation
directory.

--Matt
